= Loyola University Chicago Stritch School of Medicine - Prompt 07

#section_label("Prompt metadata")
- Title: Gaps, Delays, or Academic Missteps
- Limit: 1500 characters
- Cycle used in this repo: 2025-2026 from Med School Insiders
- Source: https://medschoolinsiders.com/medical-school-secondary-prompts-database/loyola-university-secondary-essay-prompts/
- Local notes file: prompt-07.local.md

#section_label("Prompt text")
Please explain in more detail anything that would help us understand any gaps or delays in your education, academic missteps, or personal challenges not listed elsewhere.

#section_label("Shared backbone files")
- typst/shared/academic-context.typ
- typst/shared/additional-info.typ

#section_label("academic-context backbone")
= Academic Context Backbone

== Context
State the issue plainly: low grades, withdrawals, extended timeline, or a break.

== Accountability
Own what is yours without overexplaining.

== Recovery
- What changed?
- What evidence shows improvement?
- What habits or systems are now different?
#section_label("additional-info backbone")
= Additional Information Backbone

Use this only if it adds real signal.

== Good Uses
- Important context not shown elsewhere
- Meaningful updates
- Clarifying unusual application features

== Avoid
- Repeating your personal statement
- Defensive explanations without insight
- Generic praise for the school

#section_label("School-specific tailoring")
Read `../research.md` and `prompt-07.local.md` before drafting a final version.

#section_label("Draft workspace")
Use this Typst mirror for cleaner review packets once Typst is installed.
